  "display_title": "In Fact, They Only Remembered Her",
  "description": "*Promotional prologue for the homonym web novel.* \n\nAt the end of the war, a commoner knight, Clarence Holton, left everything behind and ran away, including the promised honor and happiness she could have received after winning the war. But, contrary to the expectations that no one would remember her, the imperial prince, the taciturn knight, and the genius wizard, all rose to the temple at the news that she had left. And the chase for her disappearance began.\n\n(Source: Korean Publisher, translated)",
